Package: MscoreDMR
Type: Package
Title: Differentially Methylated Regions from mHap Data Using M-Score GLS
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jiantao", "Shi", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jtshi@cmpt.ac.cn")
Description: Detects differentially methylated regions (DMRs) from
    read-level methylation haplotype ('mHap') files. Every methylation
    string character is aligned to an absolute CpG coordinate, candidate
    regions are found by locally smoothing the between-group M-score
    difference (following the 'dmrseq' candidate discovery procedure),
    each candidate is tested with a two-stage Beta-Bernoulli generalized
    least-squares model, and significance is calibrated against a pooled
    group-label permutation null with Benjamini-Hochberg false discovery
    rate control. Inputs are streamed in bounded batches so that
    whole-genome data can be analysed with limited memory.
